---
// Shown instead of the home page while "maintenance" is on in src/data/site-status.json.
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>Under Construction | Mission Bay Community News</title>
    <style is:inline>
      body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; background-color: #0c1a24; color: #f4efe6; text-align: center; padding: 1.5rem; }
      .card { max-width: 520px; border: 1px solid #d4af37; padding: 2.5rem 2rem; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); }
      h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: #d4af37; }
      p { line-height: 1.6; color: #cbd5e1; }
      a { color: #d4af37; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="card">
      <h1>Site Under Construction</h1>
      <p>Mission Bay Community News is undergoing updates. Please check back soon!</p>
      <p>Questions? <a href="/contact/">Contact the editor</a></p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
